rse being handed koG (10c); and the grant or stand-down bar falling BELOW renderGuardBar's clear branch (15e, 15f), where it can never draw - inside a grant the filtered ladder reads clear, so a blank bar cannot be told from safe water (static/js/berth.js, and grantTick / stopAtBerth / standDownEnd / helmStoodDown / renderGrantBar in static/asv.html). AND 12d (2026-09-28): both berth stops count as the guard's own moves (guardMove), so a held resume in flight will not Start over either." ;;
